  "title": "Apex Capital Joins the Triumph Network",
  "summary": "TriumphPay announced today the addition of Apex Capital, a top-rated freight factoring provider offering fast, reliable payment solutions for carriers to the TriumphPay Network. By joining the TriumphPay Network, Apex Capital is reducing friction often associated with collecting payments from brokers and shippers. Adding Apex Capital to the TriumphPay Network represents another significant milestone for […]",
